    "contentV2": {
      "root": {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "Chocolate lava cake is one of the most loved chocolate desserts in the world. Known for its soft exterior and molten chocolate center, this elegant dessert originated in France and has become a favorite in restaurants and home kitchens alike.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "What makes this dessert special is the contrast between the delicate cake outside and the warm, flowing chocolate inside. When baked correctly, the center remains soft and gooey while the edges set perfectly.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "This recipe is incredibly simple and requires only a few basic ingredients such as chocolate, butter, eggs, sugar, and flour. The preparation takes only about 10 minutes, and the cakes bake quickly, making it a perfect last-minute dessert when you want something impressive.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "For the best result, use high-quality dark chocolate with at least 60–70% cocoa content. This will give the cake a deep and intense chocolate flavor.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "You can serve chocolate lava cake with:",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
